      "machineHash": "4fccdc6c73e892f528cab422cc3db003eb6d1973ba03e999d37c012d0f488a53",
      "machineText": "全局快捷键使用 Carbon Event Manager 的热键 API。这是 macOS 上实现系统级热键的标准机制，不需要辅助功能权限。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "Global shortcuts use the Carbon Event Manager's hot key API. This is the standard mechanism for syst…",
      "provider": "codex",
