      "machineHash": "ce8badabe5a42da5ac21395b09c1ec74d0e9acbf50b3d4dd87b09cd5dcb829a3",
      "machineText": "在**X11**会话中，Wails 直接从 X 服务器抓取快捷键，因此请求的加速键会完全按指定内容绑定。",
      "status": "machine-translated",
      "sourcePreview": "On **X11** sessions Wails grabs the shortcut directly from the X server, so the requested accelerato…",
